(The Shikshantar Academy School Management System \(SAMS\) is an institutional ERP tailored specifically to the operational,) Tj
T* (economic, and regulatory needs of schooling in Nepal. Operating on a dual calendar system \(Bikram Sambat B.S. and Gregorian) Tj
T* (A.D.\), SAMS bridges traditional paper-based ledger registers \(Khatas\) with high-integrity digital ledger tracking.) Tj
